-- =============================================================================
-- Starter content for Explore (draft text, to be checked before launch)
-- =============================================================================
-- Guides: written from general knowledge of the procedures, with links to the
-- official sites. last_verified_on is NULL on purpose, so the app shows
-- "Not yet checked against the official source" until someone verifies each
-- guide and sets the date (admin panel, later step).
-- Directory: a few government hospitals with paediatric departments. No phone
-- numbers are filled in: our team must confirm details first (verified_on).
-- Offers: none. Our team adds real ones; we never invent offers.
-- =============================================================================

